{"version":"2026.10.11-r25","id":"Q5578934","formula":"AuF₇","hill":"AuF7","elements":["F","Au"],"composition":{"F":7.0,"Au":1.0},"names":{"en":"Gold heptafluoride","ru":"Гептафторид золота(V)"},"descriptions":{"en":"Gold heptafluoride is a gold(V) compound with the empirical formula AuF7. The synthesis of this compound from gold pentafluoride and a monatomic fluorine plasma was first reported in 1986. However, current calculations suggest that the structure of the synthesized molecule was actually a difluorine ligand on a gold pentafluoride core, AuF5·F2.","ru":"Ге́птафтори́д золота(V) — бинарное неорганическое химическое соединение золота со фтором с эмпирической формулой AuF7. Впервые это вещество было синтезировано в 1986 году. Как было доказано квантово-химическими расчетами, структура гептафторида золота на самом деле представляет собой лиганд пентафторида золота и фтора: AuF5 · F2."},"fame":10,"pubchemCid":null,"mass":null,"charge":0,"smiles":null,"inchikey":null,"iupac":null,"classes":[{"qid":"Q113145171","names":{"en":"type of chemical entity","ru":"тип химического объекта","uk":"тип хімічної сутності"}}],"structureInfo":null,"structure":null,"sources":[{"role":"identity","name":"Wikidata","url":"https://www.wikidata.org/wiki/Q5578934","license":"CC0 1.0"},{"role":"description","name":"Wikipedia (en)","url":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Gold_heptafluoride","license":"CC BY-SA 4.0"},{"role":"description","name":"Wikipedia (ru)","url":"https://ru.wikipedia.org/wiki/%D0%93%D0%B5%D0%BF%D1%82%D0%B0%D1%84%D1%82%D0%BE%D1%80%D0%B8%D0%B4_%D0%B7%D0%BE%D0%BB%D0%BE%D1%82%D0%B0%28V%29","license":"CC BY-SA 4.0"}],"similar":[{"id":"Q118131254","formula":"AuF₆","names":{"en":"Gold hexafluoride"},"elements":["F","Au"],"fame":5,"kind":"molecule"},{"id":"Q3239166","formula":"AuF₅","names":{"en":"Gold(V) fluoride","ru":"Фторид золота(V)"},"elements":["F","Au"],"fame":20,"kind":"crystal"},{"id":"Q417165","formula":"F₇I","names":{"en":"Iodine heptafluoride","ru":"Фторид иода(VI